append","v":{"133":"Computer and home office UPS","125":"I'd buy something else","137":"Under $500","128":"What do you primarily want the P1800 for?","126":"These are my buying thresholds, not guaranteed market prices.","122":"$400\u2013$450","132":"Solar power and off-grid use","123":"Compare against BLUETTI","139":"$700\u2013$1,000","144":"Best long-term warranty","141":"Best reliability and value","129":"1. Intended use","130":"Home emergency backup (refrigerator, lights, electronics)","135":"2. Budget","127":"One question that would help me make a better recommendation","136":"Under $300","138":"$500\u2013$700","142":"Lowest price","140":"3. What's most important?","134":"A combination of these","143":"Maximum battery capacity","131":"Camping and RV","124":"Above $450"}},{"p":"/message/metadata/model_dil_v2/fallbackMarkdown","o":"replace","v":"# Is the ALLPOWERS P1800 worth buying?\n\n\ue200image_group\ue202{\"query\":[\"ALLPOWERS P1800 1024Wh portable power station product front view\"],\"aspect_ratio\":\"3:4\",\"layout\":\"carousel\",\"num_per_query\":1}\ue201\n\n**\ue200entity\ue202[\"product\",\"ALLPOWERS P1800\",\"1024Wh LiFePO4 portable power station\"]\ue201**\n\n# \\$419\u2013\\$439\n\nRecently advertised US prices; availability and discounts vary.\n\n(Good budget value)\n\n**My verdict: Yes, but with reservations.** The P1800 looks attractive for camping, occasional power outages, and running everyday appliances. However, I would not buy it solely because of its impressive advertised specifications.\n\nThe biggest concern is that independent real-world testing and warranty information are less convincing than those of more established competitors.\n\n## What you get\n\n| Specification | ALLPOWERS P1800 |\n|--------|--------|\n| Battery capacity | 1,024 Wh |\n| Continuous AC output | 1,800 W |\n| Surge output | 3,600 W |\n| Battery chemistry | LiFePO4 |\n| AC outlets | 4 |\n| USB-C | 2 \u00d7 140 W |\n| Solar input | Up to 650 W |\n| UPS switchover | Advertised \u226410 ms |\n| Weight | 28.7 lb |\n| Battery cycle rating | 3,000+ |\n\nSources: published specifications and independent product comparisons. \ue200cite\ue202turn663568search0\ue202turn663568search1\ue202turn663568search9\ue201\n\n**What's particularly good\\:**\n\n- LiFePO4 battery chemistry, generally preferable for long-term cycle life.\n- 1,800 W output can run many household appliances.\n- Two powerful 140 W USB-C ports.\n- Fast AC charging, advertised at approximately 80% in one hour.\n- Relatively compact for its power output.\n\n## The drawbacks I'd pay attention to\n\n(Important buying considerations)\n\n1. **No independent capacity test yet.** The advertised 1,024 Wh hasn't been independently verified in the reviews I found.\n2. **Warranty confusion.** Some listings advertise five years, but the US warranty policy reportedly provides a shorter base warranty and doesn't clearly identify the P1800 as a five-year model.\n3. **No expansion capability.** You cannot add another battery to increase capacity.\n4. **Conflicting specifications.** Published cycle life and UPS switching times differ between some listings.\n5. **Unclear safety certification.** One independent review found no verifiable safety certification for this particular model.\n\nThese are meaningful concerns, particularly if you're buying it for emergency home backup. \ue200cite\ue202turn370509search4\ue202turn370509search6\ue202turn370509search7\ue201\n\n## Where I'd buy it\n\nHere are the options I'd consider.\n\n\ue200image_group\ue202{\"query\":[\"ALLPOWERS P1800 portable power station\"],\"aspect_ratio\":\"1:1\",\"layout\":\"carousel\",\"num_per_query\":1}\ue201\n\n**1\\. Amazon \u2014 approximately \\$419**\n\n(My first choice if available)\n\n- Convenient returns.\n- Look for the ALLPOWERS official seller.\n- Check warranty coverage before ordering.\n\n\ue200url\ue202Find ALLPOWERS P1800 on Amazon\ue202https://www.amazon.com/s?k=ALLPOWERS+P1800\ue201 \ue200cite\ue202turn370509search7\ue202turn370509search11\ue201\n\n---\n\n\ue200image_group\ue202{\"query\":[\"ALLPOWERS P1800 power station product\"],\"aspect_ratio\":\"1:1\",\"layout\":\"carousel\",\"num_per_query\":1}\ue201\n\n**2\\. ALLPOWERS official US store \u2014 \\$439 advertised**\n\n- 30-day money-back return policy.\n- US warehouse shipping.\n- Advertised warranty up to five years, but confirm P1800 coverage.\n\n(Listed as sold out in the latest listing I found)\n\n\ue200url\ue202ALLPOWERS official product page\ue202https://iallpowers.com/products/allpowers-p1800-portable-power-station-1024wh-1800w\ue201 \ue200cite\ue202turn370509search8\ue202turn370509search10\ue201\n\n**One warning\\:** I found another site, `iallpower.com`, advertising \\$251.40. The established US store I found is `iallpowers.com` \\(with an additional s). I would avoid the unusually cheap listing until its seller legitimacy and warranty are verified. \ue200cite\ue202turn370509search0\ue202turn370509search8\ue201\n\n## Alternatives worth considering\n\nIf you're willing to spend a little more, I'd compare these\\:\n\n\ue200image_group\ue202{\"query\":[\"BLUETTI Elite 100 V2 portable power station\"],\"aspect_ratio\":\"5:4\",\"layout\":\"carousel\",\"num_per_query\":1}\ue201\n\n**\ue200entity\ue202[\"product\",\"BLUETTI Elite 100 V2\"]\ue201**\n\n## \\$499\n\n- 1,024 Wh\n- 1,800 W output\n- Up to 1,000 W solar input\n- 5-year warranty\n\nMy preferred alternative if reliability and warranty matter more than saving \\$80. \ue200cite\ue202turn370509search6\ue201\n\n---\n\n\ue200image_group\ue202{\"query\":[\"Anker SOLIX C1000 Gen 2 power station\"],\"aspect_ratio\":\"5:4\",\"layout\":\"carousel\",\"num_per_query\":1}\ue201\n\n**\ue200entity\ue202[\"product\",\"Anker SOLIX C1000 Gen 2\"]\ue201**\n\n## \\$549.99\n\n- 1,024 Wh\n- 2,000 W output\n- 24.9 lb\n- 5-year warranty\n\nMy choice for a more established brand and higher output. \ue200cite\ue202turn370509search6\ue201\n\n## My final recommendation\n\n| Price of P1800 | My opinion |\n|--------|--------|\n| Under \\$300 | Excellent deal, subject to seller verification |\n| \\$300\u2013\\$350 | Very attractive |\n| \\$350\u2013\\$400 | Good deal |\n| \\$400\u2013\\$450 | Compare against BLUETTI |\n| Above \\$450 | I'd buy something else |\n\nThese are my buying thresholds, not guaranteed market prices.\n\n---\n\n## One question that would help me make a better recommendation\n\n**What do you primarily want the P1800 for?**\n\n**1\\. Intended use**\n\nHome emergency backup (refrigerator, lights, electronics)\n\nCamping and RV\n\nSolar power and off-grid use\n\nComputer and home office UPS\n\nA combination of these\n\n---\n\n**2\\. Budget**\n\nUnder \\$300\n\nUnder \\$500\n\n\\$500\u2013\\$700\n\n\\$700\u2013\\$1,000\n\n---\n\n**3\\. What's most important?**\n\nBest reliability and value\n\nLowest price\n\nMaximum battery capacity\n\nBest long-term warranty"},{"p":"/message/metadata/model_dil_v2/appData/opGenui/componentResults/6a501449-4b60-543b-91b6-71a191bd9f68/state/is_loading","o":"replace","v":false},{"p":"/message/metadata/model_dil_v2/appData/opGenui/componentResults/6a501449-4b60-543b-91b6-71a191bd9f68/state/images","o":"append","v":[{"url":"https://www.bluettipower.com/products/elite-100-v2-portable-power-station?_pos=1&_sid=d51006038&_ss=r&afsrc=1&id=685df88a258285bb41303e64&irgwc=1&variant=47048300232923","content_url":"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/BU5g2J3LsXS6UHf42muPozA26m-DAeztwI9Enk-biqGWcIXecLdTZSn1JL-tWMrlb9_LhzEGKh1mWYrk8cRiTScETI1Gta4XRjI2BABPDYHKO20X_6nsV11QYtCTBkWs1AbVCvICaYK9p5sqsoxIVbUimTiDEkK5cFZgRVkwVP05itgTJ3wB5Fk9Lf4Pr-VD?purpose=fullsize","thumbnail_url":"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/ciWwvXx-3pF5N8-qiaUVRoN5-tYzS9iDc7DUNUjcByKaBii3BmIPFO6eC1061xld3dtf8viT_J6vm2RLLb1qfO_Er6wsjHfPsE2g16xzaNou3UblTLJB_lQXzbnUBMnjQpi5UuqmnAXfFvj1gnD176hoFY_TNf_Ch45WyhhSabk?purpose=inline","original_content_url":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0536/3390/8911/files/Elite_100_V2_SP100L_1x_e407bb64-3